```console
$ scherzo-cloud run inputs show --help
Show the retained input inventory for a run

Usage: scherzo-cloud run inputs show [OPTIONS] <ORGANIZATION> <RUN>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <RUN>           Exact Run ID

Options:
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
      --json                 Write one JSON result to standard output
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
